00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:38.000
Erin Smith: Okay, and for the keywords, like, what is best practice? Like, it's best, like, if it's low competition, but high searches? Like, how should I pick the top 10?

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:41.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I think, ideally, it's like…

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: To answer your question on like.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: competition, or… I think the lower the competition, the higher the search, obviously the better, but in most cases, it's, like, sometimes like that. I think I'd just say whatever is searched.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:19:01.000
Carmen Cruickshank: regardless of competition. And it's just it's specific enough for your business to where you're not getting all these searches. But it's not like.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: uh…

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Carmen Cruickshank: not searched at all. So just basically, I wouldn't really overthink it. So, like, for example, with your, uh…

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.000
Erin Smith: Okay.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: the main wedding one like we just had, you know, wedding venues, small wedding venues, you know, New York City wedding venues, and those performed really well, I think, as long as it has 50 searches or above. Now for the ceremony one, since that is more specific, if it has like.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.000
Erin Smith: Yeah.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: 20 searches or more, I think I'd count it well. Uh, but just as long as it's, like.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: people would search it, and they find your ad, and they're like, oh, this is relevant for what I'm searching. That's really the criteria I only have.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.000
Erin Smith: Okay.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:44.000
Erin Smith: So, sorry, you said more than 20 searches?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Searches if it's like a very specific thing you're doing an ad for. So like, for example, with the wedding venue one that we had originally like a few months ago.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:20:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: That one, I would have 50 or more searches for a keyword to count for me, because that's bigger, but this… the ceremony one, which is slightly smaller, if it has at least 20 searches, I'll add it in.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.000
Erin Smith: Okay.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.000
Erin Smith: Okay.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:07.000
